  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/9DE55C">Definition <span data-tag="9DE55C">1.2.16.1</span>.</a>Kan@$\Kan $ Let $\Kan $ denote the full subcategory of $\sSet $ spanned by the collection of Kan complexes. We will regard $\Kan $ as a simplicial category. Let $\SSet = \Nerve (\Kan )$ denote the (simplicial) nerve of $\Kan $. We will refer to $\SSet $ as the <em>$\infty $-category of spaces</em>.SSet@$\SSet $$\infty $-category!of spaces </p>
